# BrandGenie – Adobe Express Add-on

---

## The Problem
- Brand setup is tedious and manual
- Inconsistent branding leads to lost trust
- Most users skip Brand Kits due to friction

---

## The Solution: BrandGenie
- Upload a logo or enter a website URL
- Instantly generate a Brand Kit: colors, fonts, templates
- Powered by AI and Adobe Firefly

---

## How It Works
1. User uploads logo or enters URL
2. BrandGenie analyzes colors, fonts, and style
3. Previews palette and font set
4. One click: creates Brand Kit in Express

---

## Live Demo
- Analyze a logo or website
- Preview palette and fonts
- Create Brand Kit
- BrandGuard linter: real-time warnings for off-brand colors/fonts

---

## Technical Highlights
- Cloudflare Worker for fast analysis
- Firefly API for AI-enhanced palettes/templates
- Express Add-on SDK for Brand Kit creation
- Real-time BrandGuard linter

---

## Impact
- Saves hours for every new brand
- Makes professional branding accessible to all
- Ready for production and scale

